#: ../../docs/introduction/intro-crativ.rst:4 e4cc3df708e94c2e962d636b509e4a87
msgid "CRATIV Platform"
msgstr "CRATIV Platform"

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro-crativ.rst:6 36427a722a274cb6a624511b05a01452
msgid ""
"cnSRC platform also includes a CRATIV system, mainly used for preliminary "
"data processing and software development. Remote login can be done using VNC "
"software, and software is managed using the module system. For further "
"details, please feel free to reach out to us via email at shaoska@shao.ac.cn "
"or chinasrc@googlegroups.com for inquiries."
msgstr ""
"cnSRC platform also includes a CRATIV system, mainly used for preliminary "
"data processing and software development. Remote login can be done using VNC "
"software, and software is managed using the module system. For further "
"details, please feel free to reach out to us via email at shaoska@shao.ac.cn "
"or chinasrc@googlegroups.com for inquiries."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro-crativ.rst:12 65f56c6f4222400db3ad93c75ce04185
msgid "CRATIV has 256G RAM/50TB Storage/Intel(R) Xeon(R) CPU E5-2698."
msgstr "CRATIV has 256G RAM/50TB Storage/Intel(R) Xeon(R) CPU E5-2698."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro-crativ.rst:15 17fbc69c9d3749b7adae1d344d40fb45
msgid ""
"The easiest way to use the software on the CRATIV system is to use the "
"initial script."
msgstr ""
"The easiest way to use the software on the CRATIV system is to use the "
"initial script."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro-crativ.rst:21 d4ec7066d3ac42ed8c9833e1c5c9cfc2
msgid "Then you can use the software."
msgstr "Then you can use the software."

#: ../../docs/introduction/intro-crativ.rst:25 a401d62c68a247b2b99117ec0ad2bd31
msgid ""
"You can also use the module system to manage the software if you want to."
msgstr ""
"You can also use the module system to manage the software if you want to."

